{"strongs": "H4940", "word": "מִשְׁפָּחָה", "translit": "mish.pa.chah", "root": "שפח", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "clan", "definition": "מִשְׁפָּחָה : 303 noun feminine clan ( RS Semitic 1. 258, 2nd ed. 276; K 149, 2nd ed. 175 Ba NB § 161 a ); — absolute ׳ מ Amos 3:1 +; construct מִשְׁפַּ֫חַת Judg 9:1 +; suffix מִשְׁפַּחְתִּי Gen 24:38 +, etc.; plural מִשְׁפָּחוֺת Nah 3:4 +; construct מִשְׁפְּחוֺת Amos 3:2 +; suffix מִשְׁפְּחֹתֵיהֶם Gen 8:19 + 2 t., usually תָם - Num 1:18 + 84 t., etc.; — 1. clan: \\ \\ a. family connection of individual Gen 24:38 (+ בֵּיתאָֿבִי ), v Gen 24:40 ( + id. ), v Gen 24:41 (all J ; = מוֺלַדְתִּי v Gen 24:4 ), 2Sam 14:7 , united in sacrifice 1Sam 20:6 ; 1Sam 20:29 , in passover Exod 12:21 ( J E ; compare Benz Ency.Bib. PASSOVER, §§ 9, 12 ); compare Lev 20:5 ( H ), Lev 25:10 ; Lev 25:41 ( P ), v Lev 25:49 ( P ; defined as מִשְּׁאֵר בְּשָׂרוֺ ), non-Hebrew v Lev 25:47 ( H ), v Lev 25:45 ( P ), Judg 1:25 מִשְׁפְּחוֺתֶיהָ Josh 6:23 ( E or R ) is unintelligible, probably strike out (compare Steuern Holz ; בֵּית אָבִיהָ in v Josh 6:25 [ J ]), compare Num 27:4 ; Num 27:11 ( P ); בֵּית אֲבִי אִמּוֺ ׳ מ Judg 9:1 clan of his mother's father-house ; including individuals, and included by שֵׁבֶט 1Sam 9:21 (twice in verse); 1Sam 10:21 with specific name, in series גֶבֶר , בַּיִת , ׳ מ , שֵׁבֶט Josh 7:14 (twice in verse); Josh 7:17 b, c (all J ; v Josh 7:17 a read plural Di Benn , or שֵׁבֶט GFM Judg 13:2 ; Steuern allows either); compare Deut 29:17 ; Judg 21:24 , ׳ אָבִי בְּיִשׂ ׳ מ 1Sam 1:18 (+ חַיַּי , see II [ חַי ]; בֵּיתשָֿׁאוּל ׳ אִישׁמִ֗֗֗מּ 2Sam 16:5 with name also Ruth 2:1 ; Ruth 2:3 and (non-Israel) Job 32:2 . \\ \\ b. in loose, popular sense= tribe, Judg 13:2 ; Judg 17:7 ; Judg 18:19 , compare v Judg 18:2 (|| שֵׁבֶט v Judg 18:1 ), v Judg 18:11 (yet in these two read possibly plural, see GFM ). \\ \\ c. techn. divisions of people of Israel Num 11:10 ( J ) Jer 2:4 ; Jer 31:1 compare Jer 3:14 ; Num 1:2 ; Num 1:18 ; Num 2:34 ; Num 33:54 (all P ), so (post-exilic) Neh 4:7 : Esth 9:28 ( מְדִינָה , ׳ מ , דּוֺר ). \\ \\ d. usually ( P ) technical divisions of tribes of Israel , Exod 6:14 ; Exod 6:15 ; Exod 6:25 ; Num 3:15 + 112 t. Numbers (93 t. Num 26 , including v Num 3:43 where הַשּׁוּחָמִי apparently = Dan), 34 t. Josh 13-21; also 1Chr 6:4 ; 1Chr 6:45 ; 1Chr 7:5 ; division of Gershom, etc. (in Levi) Num 3:18 ; Num 3:19 ; Num 3:20 + 41 t. Exodus, Numbers, Joshua, Chronicles; subdivisions of these divisions (in Levi) Num 3:21 (twice in verse) + 6 t. Num 3 + Num 4:18 compare (in other tribes) 1Chr 2:53 ; 1Chr 4:2 ; 1Chr 4:8 ; 1Chr 4:21 ; 1Chr 4:27 ; 1Chr 4:38 ; 1Chr 5:7 also Zech 12:12 b. c 13 b 14 a, and (distributive) v Zech 12:12 a 14 b, pleonastic מַטֵּה אֲבִיהֶם ׳ מ Num 36:6 compare v Num 36:8 , and ( ׳ א ׳ מַטֵּה מ ) v Num 36:12 . \\ \\ e. late, divinity of other peoples 1Chr 16:28 = Ps 96:7 ; Ps 22:28 in Edom Gen 36:40 ( P ). feminine in wider sense=people, nation ; כֹּל מִשְׁפְּחֹת תָאֲדָמָה Amos 3:2 ; Gen 12:3 ; Gen 28:14 (both J ), compare Jer 10:25 ; Ezek 20:32 ; Nah 3:4 (all || גּוֺיִם ), Zech 14:17 ; Jer 1:15 ; Jer 25:9 as one's posterity Gen 10:30 ; Gen 10:31 ; Gen 10:32 (all P ), so probably v Gen 10:5 ( P ; Di Dr ); = all Israel Amos 3:1 , Judah Mic 2:3 ; Jer 8:3 ( הָרָעָה הַזּאֹת ׳ הַמּ ), Israel + Judah, ׳ שְׁתֵּי הַמּ Jer 33:24 מִשְׁפַּחַת מִצְרַיִם Zech 14:18 compare Ps 107:41 . 2. = guild 1Chr 2:55 (of scribes; originally hereditary in families). 3. = species, kind: \\ \\ a. of judgments Jer 15:3 . b . animals Gen 8:19 ( P ). 4. plural = aristocrats Job 31:34 (compare English 'the classes'). שֻׁפִּים proper name, masculine see √ שׁפף .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8954')\">BDB8954</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4940')\">H4940</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8953')\">BDB8953</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8955')\">BDB8955</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּחָה</bdbheb>: 303 <b>noun feminin